..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. Name           : owfo/MX.SAM.EV
.. Date           :
.. Version        :
.. Author         : mage, abas software ag
.. Functionality  : Sperren setzen fÅr verdÑchtige Objekte
..
.. Interface (arguments and their meaning)
..    uses array argument (arg.i)           : no
..    uses name argument  (xpname=value)    : no
..
..    Argument     meaning
..    -------------------------------------------------------------------------
..
.. Program flow   :
...Includes       :
..*****************************************************************************
..
..*****************************************************************************
.continue END ?  _(G|evtkommd = "Ñndern" ; G|evtkommd = "neu")
.continue MASTER  ? M|dnr = 1 ; M|dnr = 0
.continue PROCESS ? M|dnr = 3 ; M|dnr = 4
.continue END
..
!MASTER
.. Kunde und Lieferanten
.. Sperre eintragen
.formula M|kenn =  M|kenn + ",S," ? (M|slpstatus = "icon:stop" ; M|slpstatus2 = "icon:stop")  & _(F|regmatch(M|kenn, ".*,S,.*"))
..
.. Sperre austragen
.formula M|kenn =  F|regreplaceall(M|kenn, ",S," , "") ? (_M|slpstatus = "icon:stop" & _M|slpstatus2 = "icon:stop")  & F|regmatch(M|kenn, ".*,S,.*")
.rewrite screen
.continue END
..
!PROCESS
.. EK / VK
.. Sperre eintragen
.formula M|vsperre =  G|true  ? (M|slpstatus = "icon:stop" ; M|slpstatus2 = "icon:stop")  & _(M|vsperre)
..
.. Sperre austragen
.formula M|vsperre =  G|false ? (_M|slpstatus = "icon:stop" & _M|slpstatus2 = "icon:stop")  & M|vsperre
.rewrite screen
.continue END
..
!END
.continue
